# net.env - variables every program the console runs gets when the NETDATA
# disk is mounted at /opt/net (W24-S01, like qt.env and x11.env): where its
# CA bundle is, for curl and other TLS programs. It sets no PATH: x11.env's
# would be shadowed when both disks are attached, so the disk's programs are
# run as /opt/net/bin/<name>. Docs: docs/04-plan/waves/WAVE-24-ssh-browser.md.
SSL_CERT_FILE=/opt/net/etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt
CURL_CA_BUNDLE=/opt/net/etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt
